  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>阿里云云栖号</span> <span>2026-09-19 10:33</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">浙江</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919104637_4658ade.jpeg\"></p>\n  <div data-role=\"paragraph\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"166208\">\n    <div>\n     <div>\n      <p data-ignore-width=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">云栖大会 Skill 正式上线千问 AI 平台。4 大展馆、120 多场分论坛，一句话帮你逛展台、听论坛。</span></span></p>\n      <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n   <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">先安装，再直接问</span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-weight: bold\">云栖大会 Skill 基于开放的 Agent Skills 标准开发，Codex、OpenClaw、Claude Code、Cursor 等支持 Skills 的 Agent 都能用，推荐千问办公和 Qoder。</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">打开你常用的 Agent，在对话框中输入并发送：</span></span></p>\n   <div>\n    <div data-id=\"105248\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\n     <p class=\"code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js\"></p>\n     <ul class=\"code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js\"></ul>\n     <pre class=\"code-snippet__js\" data-lang=\"bash\"><code><span leaf=\"\">复制代码</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">npx skills add QianWen-AI/apsara-conference-2026</span></code><br></pre>\n     <p></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">按照提示完成安装后，直接用自然语言提问，不需要再记命令。例如：</span></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n     <div data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4maOgX3Kw6kKvlWN\">\n      <p data-role=\"list\"></p>\n      <ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n       <li>\n        <div>\n         <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">\"有哪些 Agent 相关论坛值得看？\"</span></span></p>\n        </div>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <div>\n         <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">\"帮我订阅这几场论坛。\"</span></span></p>\n        </div>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <div>\n         <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">\"智能馆有哪些值得看的展台？\"</span></span></p>\n        </div>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <div>\n         <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">\"我订的论坛有没有摘要可以领取？\"</span></span></p>\n        </div>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p></p>\n      <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n       <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">展馆怎么逛，</span></p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">先让 Agent 帮你找重点</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">你可以从技术方向、行业兴趣或具体产品出发，让 Agent 查询展馆、展区和展台信息。想看 Agentic 应用、模型、算力，或者关注游戏、零售、汽车等行业，都可以直接问。到了现场，这能帮你少走弯路，把时间留给真正想看的展台；不在现场，也能先弄清楚各馆展示什么、哪些内容和自己有关。</span></span></p>\n       <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">论坛撞期，先筛选再取舍</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">面对密集议程，可以让 Agent 按时间、地点、主题和技术方向筛选论坛，查看具体议题，并订阅想参加或想继续跟进的场次。多个论坛撞期时，不必只看标题做选择。先了解每场讲什么，再决定哪场必须亲自去，哪场留待会后补课。对于已开放摘要服务的论坛，结束约 3 小时后可领取内容摘要，还可以继续追问核心观点、重要发布和技术亮点。</span></span></p>\n       <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">到不到现场，都能继续跟进</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">除了展馆和论坛，云栖大会 Skill 还可以查询直播，以及交通、住宿、餐饮、门票和签到等参会信息。它不会代替你到现场交流和体验，但可以帮你提前找方向、现场查信息、会后补内容。人负责交流、体验和判断，Agent 负责找、筛、记和补。9 月 22 日至 24 日，调用云栖大会Skill，带着 Agent 一起参加 2026 云栖大会。</span></span></p>\n       <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">END</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.43148148148148147\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/j7RlD5l5q1xslLLwkvdicgATpFI07giaqTmuJHXjuHqvmQpendc0drumqKyzbOPLx0bNQD0Oke0tt6hWALzdoic1jBMEET8cQkC9c48AicFvHYA/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"249\" data-imgfileid=\"100078770\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919104637_a843644.png\"></span></p>\n    <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n     <div>\n      <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n       <div data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4maOgX3Kw6kKvlWN\">\n        <div data-role=\"paragraph\" data-pm-slice=\"4 4 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-role&quot;:&quot;paragraph&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-role&quot;:&quot;paragraph&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key&quot;:&quot;4maOgX3Kw6kKvlWN&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">\n         <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62)\">千问</span></span><span l